The patch adds MIPI-DSI based s6e8aa0 AMOLED LCD 5.3 inch panel driver.
Driver uses mipi_dsi bus to communicate with panel and exposes drm_panel
interface.

Signed-off-by: Andrzej Hajda <a.hajda@samsung.com>
